ABOUT

mac-Cons is a library of dark mode app icons, made for Apple design
on your own device. It contains Apple icons and icons of other apps.
The icons are either official Apple icons or were made by the
author in Figma. Only the author uploads content to this repository.

By using any file from this project, you agree to the terms below.


PERMITTED

You may use the icons for personal use, on your own device.


NOT PERMITTED

You may not:

  1. Use the icons for any commercial purpose.
  2. Re-upload or redistribute the icons to any website, including
     icon websites.
  3. Sell the icons.
  4. Offer the icons through subscriptions, memberships, or any
     other form of paid access.
  5. Claim the icons as your own work.


NO PARTNERSHIPS

This project has no partnerships and is not affiliated with any
company. All names, logos, and icons belong to their respective
owners.


VIOLATIONS

Any violation of this license ends your right to use the icons. The
author may request the removal of the content from any website or
platform.


NO WARRANTY

The icons are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
